3\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n# \u4f5c\u54c1\u3092\u4fdd\u5b58\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u7d9a\u304d\u3092\n\u4f5c\u3063\u305f\u4f5c\u54c1\u306f\u4fdd\u5b58\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u3067\u3001\u5c11\u3057\u305a\u3064\u4f5c\u54c1\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u4e0a\u3052\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\n\n\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u64cd\u4f5c\u3084\u6c7a\u307e\u3063\u305f\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\n\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u60f3\u50cf\u529b\u3092\u3001Blocca\u3067\u81ea\u7531\u306b\u5f62\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002", "short_description": "\u60f3\u50cf\u3092\u3001\u30ab\u30bf\u30c1\u306b\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1414_Blocca.png", "id": "2527770407701908", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593875952_2527770411035241_86962905040368940_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kGXTWeJmlf4Q7kNvwGMPCSR&_nc_oc=AdpAyTwFWFGsiBdkLS0Sy6KC-jtCDwarelxxIaRmA6C9dZefSSg9QAqvmwS8I61kgjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR-stBy-kCg5jjBgk1ICQQMxUXbzLnrw7kxcqp-IXkU9A&oe=6B0DA232"}, {"file_name": "2514_Blocca.png", "id": "2151075992465671", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626728_2151075995799004_2830814670518602092_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y-xes7_5WLAQ7kNvwE8z32f&_nc_oc=Adq0nRwV6BkdXIf43kD_BTTsY3hibEDaKbK_9LcBR-81NNQh6qBz7ifCEI4mbdsXkR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTOSONu1WTgvRbIG_BcVkozw6L6vWS8lpLzutAqMXtJhg&oe=6B0DC034"}, {"file_name": "Hero_Blocca.png", "id": "1877753013206788", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620414_1877753016540121_1614686683159757733_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xs